#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/clone_engine.rst:20
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The clone brush is a brush engine that allows you to paint with a "
"duplication of a section of a paint-layer. This is useful in manipulation of "
"photos and textures. You have to select a source and then you can paint to "
"copy or clone the source to a different area. Other applications normally "
"have a separate tool for this, Krita has a brush engine for this."
msgstr ""
"Krtača za klone je motor s čopičem, ki vam omogoča slikanje z podvajanjem "
"dela barvnega sloja. To je uporabno pri manipulaciji s fotografijami in "
"teksturami. Izbrati morate vir in nato lahko slikate, da kopirate ali "
"klonirate vir na drugo področje. Druge aplikacije običajno imajo ločeno "
"orodje za to, Krita ima ščetka motor za to."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/clone_engine.rst:23
#, fuzzy
msgid "Usage and Hotkeys"
msgstr "Uporaba in hotkeys"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/clone_engine.rst:25
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To see the source, you need to set the brush-cursor settings to brush "
"outline."
msgstr ""
"Če želite videti vir, morate nastaviti nastavitve brush-cursor za oris "
"čopiča."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/clone_engine.rst:27
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The clone tool can now clone from the projection and it's possible to change "
"the clone source layer. Press the :kbd:`Ctrl +` |mouseleft| shortcut to "
"select a new clone source on the current layer."
msgstr ""
"Klonsko orodje lahko klonira iz projekcije in je mogoče spremeniti plast "
"vira klona. Pritisnite na :kbd:'Ctrl +' |mouseleft| bližnjico, da izberete "
"nov vir klona na trenutni plasti."

