msgid ""
"This turns the clone brush into a healing brush: often used for removing "
"blemishes in photo retouching, and maybe blemishes in painting."
msgstr ""
"To spremeni klon krtačo v zdravljenje čopič: pogosto se uporablja za "
"odstranjevanje blemishes v foto retuširanje, in morda blemishes pri slikanju."

